    {
      "paragraph": "To further investigate the composition and valence of N, S-PCS, X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy XPS was used. In the total spectrum of XPS Fig. S5, some iron peaks can be found in the unetched porous",
      "property_types": [
        "Elemental_Composition"
      ],
      "extracted_info": {
        "Elemental_Composition": [
          {
            "value": [
              "C",
              "N",
              "S",
              "O"
            ],
            "method": "XPS",
            "source_text": "after aqua regia etching, it was found that the Fe 2p peaks disappeared from the total spectrum, and all C, N, S, and O elements were present"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraph": "Similarly, we applied N, S-PCS to sodium-ion batteries to explore the source of good electrochemical reaction kinetics by CV and by calculating its capacitive contribution at different scan rates, the",
